# ui-ux-pro-max (demo0)

Run search **from the demo0 project root** using a **relative** path. Do not pass a full absolute path with Chinese directory names.

```powershell
cd <demo0-root>
python .cursor\skills\ui-ux-pro-max\scripts\search.py "<query>" --design-system -p "Project Name"
```

On Windows, prefer the wrapper (uses script directory, UTF-8 code page):

```powershell
.cursor\skills\ui-ux-pro-max\scripts\search.cmd "<query>" --design-system -p "Project Name"
```

Skill files live at `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/` in this repo (not under demo0-admin unless you are in that workspace folder).
